    {
      "fileName": "distracting-shadows.json",
      "id": "vcfeHDoaWEZtEcfz",
      "name": "Distracting Shadows",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "vcfeHDoaWEZtEcfz",
        "folder": "MlNGMEeedSIgPZTb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Distracting Shadows",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have learned to remain hidden by using larger folk as a distraction to avoid drawing attention to yourself. You can use creatures that are at least one size larger than you (usually Medium or larger) as cover for the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak] actions, though you still can't use such creatures as cover for other uses, such as the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover] action.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "halfling"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "folksy-patter.json",
      "id": "0YXRPqCaOQ3G73hh",
      "name": "Folksy Patter",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "0YXRPqCaOQ3G73hh",
        "folder": "MlNGMEeedSIgPZTb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Folksy Patter",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are adept at disguising coded messages as folksy idioms. Using slang, jokes, halfling loanwords, and the like, you convey a simple message consisting of three basic words (such as \"Danger assassin flee\" or \"Meet me moonrise\"). Your intended listener can attempt a @Check[perception|dc:20] check to discern the message. This DC is reduced by 5 if the listener is a halfling or has Folksy Patter, or by 10 if both apply (@Check[perception|dc:15] @Check[perception|dc:10]). Eavesdroppers can also attempt a @Check[perception|against:deception] check against your Deception DC to discern your meaning. Any bonuses or penalties to Perception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sense Motive] apply to checks to understand Folksy Patter.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "halfling"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "halfling-lore.json",
      "id": "VU07hybqzUXIJ6l2",
      "name": "Halfling Lore",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "VU07hybqzUXIJ6l2",
        "folder": "MlNGMEeedSIgPZTb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Halfling Lore",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've dutifully learned how to keep your balance and how to stick to the shadows where it's safe, important skills passed down through generations of halfling tradition. You gain the trained proficiency rank in Acrobatics and Stealth. If you would automatically become trained in one of those skills (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.</p>\n<p>You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore] general feat for Halfling Lore.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.acrobatics.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "ActiveEffectLike",
              "mode": "upgrade",
              "path": "system.skills.stealth.rank",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "key": "GrantItem",
              "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Additional Lore"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "halfling"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "halfling-luck.json",
      "id": "ZbRVqf14RTJJIZXG",
      "name": "Halfling Luck",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "ZbRVqf14RTJJIZXG",
        "folder": "MlNGMEeedSIgPZTb",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Halfling Luck",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "free"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail a skill check or saving throw.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your happy-go-lucky nature makes it seem like misfortune avoids you, and to an extent, that might even be true. You can reroll the triggering check, but you must use the new result, even if it's worse.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
          "level": {
